.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-TZVP, optimisation and frequencies. This calculation shows a hydrogen bond: a Density Profile line from the bridging H to the O of the other molecule dips to a low minimum that is not zero, far below that along the O-H bond itself.
